@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Jefe de Logística" as Jefe
actor "Sistema" as Sistema

rectangle "Sistema TekMess - Módulo Empleados" {
  usecase "Crear empleado" as UC1
  usecase "Editar empleado" as UC2
  usecase "Eliminar empleado" as UC3
  usecase "Generar credenciales" as UC4
  usecase "Validar datos del empleado" as UC5
}

Jefe --> UC1
Jefe --> UC2
Jefe --> UC3

UC1 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
UC2 ..> UC5 : <<include>>
UC1 ..> UC4 : <<include>>

note right of UC5
Validaciones críticas:
- Cédula (10 dígitos)
- Rol RBAC válido
- Correo institucional
end note
@enduml